        "name": "芒斯特：战后失地调查与殖民庄园政策涉及区",
        "label_type": "土地剥夺与殖民政策涉及区",
        "zone_type": "crown_land_dispossession_policy_study",
        "start_year": 1584,
        "end_year": 1589,
        "geography_semantics": "Munster province-scale location reference; not actual forfeited parcels, undertakers' grants, tenant displacement limits, or royal effective control boundary",
        "controller_zh": "英格兰王室土地清查与殖民筹划机构（并非该区域全域实际管治）",
        "summary_zh": "王室在德斯蒙德战争后开展查没土地调查、分配殖民庄园计划，部分调查、确权及安置存在争议和落实不足。浅赭色虚线仅帮助定位芒斯特这一政策活动地区，不是被没收土地的地块边界，更不表示当地所有土地已经由英王实际占有。",
        "source_ids": [
          "C10-S05",
          "C10-S08",
          "C10-S69",
          "C10-S70",
          "C10-S06"
        ],
        "source_urls": [
          "https://celt.ucc.ie/published/E580000-001/text004.html",
          "https://celt.ucc.ie/published/E580000-001/text005.html",
          "https://doi.org/10.7486/DRI.rb69b272p"
        ],
        "related_event_ids": [
